#   
#   changed some area == area checks to getArea == getArea (area IDs), this avoids a hash table lookup, which may speed up some of the pathfinding a little. When comparing areas, it is fine to compare areaIDs, there is no need to do the lookup to find the actual area classes and compare pointers.
